{"id":"4e50c115b0d32044","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-consistency-predicate.md","title":"一致性句Con","display":"df-consistency-predicate — 一致性句Con","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-consistency-predicate","aliases":["91-df-consistency-predicate"],"display":"df-consistency-predicate — 一致性句Con","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-consistency-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-consistency-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistency-predicate — 一致性句Con"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-consistency-predicate-—-一致性句-$\\mathrm{Con}$\">df-consistency-predicate — 一致性句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (可递归公理化的一阶理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> (固定的矛盾句)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,x)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 对编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的句子的证明这一原始递归关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prov}_S(x)\\coloneqq\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,x),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prov}_S(x)\\coloneqq\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,x),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是对象算术中的句子；其标准模型真值等价于元理论所说的\n“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 的证明”。它不同于\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\">\\(\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\\)</span>：后者只断言某个真理谓词不接受\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>，除非另有声性和释放原则，否则不能替代证明论一致性。</p>\n<p>还必须区分三种主张：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>元理论中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>背景理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>相对一致性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(U)\\to\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(U)\\to\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>保守扩张通常给出相对一致性或元理论等强结论，并不使 PA 无条件证明\n该扩张的一致性。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是一致、可递归公理化且足够强的\n算术理论，Gödel 第二不完备定理给出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(S\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span>。TB、UTB 对 PA 保守，所以不能在 PA\n不能证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 时反而证明它；标准全归纳 KF\n可以证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>，但这不是 KF 证明自身一致性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-consistency-predicate-—-一致性句-$\\mathrm{Con}$","text":"df-consistency-predicate — 一致性句 $\\mathrm{Con}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,x)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prov}_S(x)\\coloneqq\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,x),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner}).","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(U)\\to\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false}],"bytes":1685,"backlinks":[{"id":"5fc33cbab29395e4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0bb5ccbcd92bda96","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"719296019c11ec36","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c5085dd84d7b744a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"656104419469b4d0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8ad5058535b9125d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":